			<item>
				<title>About me</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/data_science_portfolio/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/data_science_portfolio/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;hi-im-kelton-&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m Kelton 👋 &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#hi-im-kelton-&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m a Machine Learning Engineer and Data Scientist based in &lt;strong&gt;Praia, Cabo Verde&lt;/strong&gt;. I work on building end-to-end ML systems, from data collection and feature engineering to model deployment and monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-i-do&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;What I do &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#what-i-do&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; — supervised/unsupervised learning, deep learning, NLP, computer vision&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science&lt;/strong&gt; — exploratory analysis, statistical modeling, data visualization&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MLOps&lt;/strong&gt; — model deployment, experiment tracking, CI/CD pipelines for ML&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;background&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Background &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#background&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Write your background here — education, work experience, what got you into ML, etc.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
