				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;books&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Books &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#books&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;foundational-ml--deep-learning&#34; class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Foundational ML &amp;amp; Deep Learning &lt;span class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700&#34; style=&#34;text-decoration-line: none !important;&#34; href=&#34;#foundational-ml--deep-learning&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Learning&lt;/strong&gt; — Goodfellow, Bengio &amp;amp; Courville&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The definitive theoretical reference for deep learning. Dense but essential.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.deeplearningbook.org/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Free online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Machine Learning with Scikit-Learn, Keras &amp;amp; TensorFlow&lt;/strong&gt; — Aurélien Géron&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Best practical introduction to ML. Great for beginners and intermediates.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/hands-on-machine-learning/9781492032632/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;O&amp;rsquo;Reilly&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing Machine Learning Systems&lt;/strong&gt; — Chip Huyen&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Essential reading for production ML. Covers the full lifecycle.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/designing-machine-learning/9781098107956/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;O&amp;rsquo;Reilly&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
